--- !u!114 &304858116
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 304858115}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 55c24004838261046b4b1c54c3d27b25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 2018754454}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1130911989}
  dialogue:
  - FOXIL'S LETTER
  - Dear brother, my mother and I told you that you have had an illness since you
    were born, the cause of which we don't know.
  - In fact, it is not a congenital disease.
  - There is a reason for this and our late mother wanted me to tell you this.
  - But the only condition was that I find the man who could cure you and then I
    would tell you.
  - I located that man. But the king of the realm came after me.
  - You may be wondering why the king's realm is after us.
  - My mother left a letter for you to find out all about it.
  - Find the Keeper of the Realm, brother. Save yourself and this realm.
  - Your loving brother, Foxil...
  wordSpeed: 0.02
  playerIsClose: 0
